# Supabase — create a project at https://supabase.com (eCommerceCanada org)
# Run supabase/00-full-schema.sql once in SQL Editor (personal encrypted sync + company tables).
#
# Migrating from an old project? See scripts/migrate-supabase-data.mjs and .env.migration.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values (never commit .env).
#
# Auth: Supabase → Authentication → Sign In / Providers → Confirm email OFF (recommended;
# Supabase’s built-in email rate limit is very low). Turn confirm on later with custom SMTP
# and optional VITE_AUTH_REDIRECT_URL / notes://auth/confirmed for desktop deep links.
#
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_your-key-here
# VITE_AUTH_REDIRECT_URL=https://your-app.netlify.app/auth/confirmed

# Netlify sets VITE_BASE=/ automatically via netlify.toml
# Desktop/Electron builds use the default base path ./
